Payloads
--------
Every prompt-injection payload shipped with tracebait is original work written for
this project. No payload text is copied from papers, datasets or other tools.

Third-party data
----------------
Incident packs under src/tracebait/data/packs/ contain small, attributed slices of public
security datasets. Each pack also records its sources' URLs and SHA-256 digests, and
scripts/build_packs.py rebuilds it from them. Selected records are kept verbatim except
for these changes: OTRF records lose their rendered Message field and have numbers
written as strings; CloudTrail records are flattened to dotted keys with non-string
values written as JSON text; nginx access-log lines are mapped to ECS; and fields that echo a record's own values, listed in
scripts/pack_recipes.py, are removed.

